On the show today:

The Daily Wire breaks more shocking news on Medicaid fraud in Ohio, and Vivek Ramaswamy joins us to talk about how to stop it;

the Met Gala puts bizarre and ostentatious anti-capitalism on display;

and I review the latest trailer for Christopher Nolan’s The Odyssey.

open.spotify.com/episode/3Sz…

On the show today:

The Daily Wire’s @lukerosiak unleashes the results of a two-month investigation into welfare fraud in Ohio;

Spirit Airlines is now a ghost;

and Tucker Carlson sits down with The New York Times and demonstrates that he’s no longer on the right in any significant way.

